  "description": "The unique user install based on new or re-install. New or re-installed is defined by checking if the user id has installed for the first time in their life or if the same user id has installed before. The same person might use a different phone number & re-install, in such a case it will be considered as a new install. The same user installing using a different device id but same phone number will be considered as a re-install.\n\nThe first logged in normal user id is attributed to that device id",
